### Agent配置管理

每个Agent需要在 `backend/app/config/settings.py` 中添加配置:

```python
class Settings(BaseSettings):
    # ... 其他配置 ...
    
    # My Agent配置
    MY_AGENT_PROVIDER: str = Field("openai", description="LLM提供商")
    MY_AGENT_MODEL: str = Field("gpt-4o", description="LLM模型名称")
    MY_AGENT_BASE_URL: str | None = Field(None, description="自定义API端点")
    MY_AGENT_API_KEY: str = Field(..., description="API密钥")
```

在 `.env` 文件中配置:
```bash
MY_AGENT_PROVIDER=openai
MY_AGENT_MODEL=gpt-4o
MY_AGENT_BASE_URL=
MY_AGENT_API_KEY=sk-xxx
```

---

### AgentFactory注册

在 `backend/app/agents/factory.py` 中注册Agent:

```python
class AgentFactory:
    def create_my_agent(self) -> MyAgent:
        """创建自定义Agent实例"""
        return MyAgent(self.settings)
```

